      "mds:offGasses": "None",
      "mds:procedureDetails": "3-(2,5-dichloropyrimidin-4-yl)imidazo[1,2-a]pyridine (4 g, 15.09 mmol), 4-amino-3-methoxybenzaldehyde (2.281 g, 15.09 mmol), 9,9-DIMETHYL-4,5-BIS(DIPHENYLPHOSPHINO)XANTHENE (0.873 g, 1.51 mmol), TRIS(DIBENZYLIDENEACETONE)DIPALLADIUM (0.345 g, 0.38 mmol) and 1,8-DIAZABICYCLO [5.4.0] UNDEC-7-ENE (5.64 ml, 37.72 mmol) were dissolved in Dioxane (120 ml) then degazed and purged with argon. The reaction was heated to reflux (bath 120°C) for 2H30.  Reaction mixture was filtered through a filter cup and concentrated. FR01132-77-01 w=14.65 g  The crude product was purified by flash chromatography (NOVASEP) on silica gel ( 15-40µm ) eluting with  0 to 5% methanol in dichloromethane. The solvent was evaporated to dryness to afford 4-(5-chloro-4-(imidazo[1,2-a]pyridin-3-yl)pyrimidin-2-ylamino)-3-methoxybenzaldehyde (34.9 %) as a clear yellow solid.  PBO-01132-77-02 w=2 g  ",
      "mds:safetyNotes": "None"
    },
